{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Detach enums and map keys too**\n\nThe copy still shares every enum instance and every map key. Enums can contain mutable state or a mutable `@JsonValue`, and a mutable key can be reached through `toWireMap()`; mutation by the handler or one exporter then changes later exporters' records. Convert enums to detached JSON scalars and copy keys using the mapper's key-serialization semantics. Add mutable-enum and mutable-key isolation tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obJ8P","finding_digest":"8e6c376214265f1d40c1c7b6864d97136c58335d2d618a641524f1e001a94dd8","finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","line":69,"observation_digest":"cf247ec7dab9d2a2fa2f95ed2d54c0fc2ff001461632c10abc38931952226dd4","observation_id":"aro_v1_z4sh5r62xhjkf6rpsxws2vga7q","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Json.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","published_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:11Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tayk6qge2h3e74wst5kjjjd6wi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"24e28b812198c4b065174ba4b7f7600305deb4ae","reviewer":"codex","start_line":59,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_5w7iq5kvuewywh77tbr6yuydlp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:11Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
